            "speaker_id": 33287,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Thanks for starting this, @95118. It's crucial we get input from all three shifts, as they often have slightly different ways of doing things. The changeover section in particular needs to be standardized to reduce waste. Can you make sure to connect with the B and C shift leads?",
